{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"9d4c72e6-d99f-4e2a-8f4f-67901a2e4685","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I have the question space. Now let me focus on Q2.4:\n\n**Q2.4**: 面向单请求内微算子并发的 Dispatcher 设计有哪些关键方法和策略？\n\nKey aspects:\n- Dispatcher 核心功能: ①计算单元依赖管理 (DAG, 拓扑排序, 就绪队列); ②任务分发与调度 (static vs dynamic binding, priority); ③同步与 barrier 管理; ④资源感知调度; ⑤SLO 感知调度\n- 硬件侧重: GPU CUDA stream/event vs NPU task descriptor queue vs TPU device-side scheduling\n- 硬件同步原语: GPU __syncthreads/warp shuffle, NPU barrier instruction, TPU collective permute\n- Dispatcher 与硬件 command processor / DMA engine 交互\n\n预关键词: Dispatcher设计, dispatcher design, 微算子DAG, micro-operator DAG, task dependency management, 就绪队列, ready queue, topology sort, 任务分发, task dispatch, static binding, dynamic binding, 优先级调度, priority scheduling, latency-critical, barrier管理, barrier management, 异步执行, asynchronous execution, callback驱动, callback-driven, 依赖解析, dependency resolution, 资源感知调度, resource-aware scheduling, SM占用监控, SM occupancy monitoring, memory-aware dispatch, SLO感知, SLO-aware, tail latency, P99 latency, energy efficiency SLO, CUDA stream, CUDA event, NPU task descriptor queue, TPU device-side scheduling, warp shuffle, barrier instruction, collective permute, command processor交互, DMA engine, hardware command queue\n\nNow I need to do semantic segmentation and search across four directories. Let me break this into sub-queries and search in parallel across the four vault directories.\n\nLet me create semantic groups:\n1. Dispatcher核心设计: Dispatcher design, micro-operator DAG, task dependency management, ready queue, topology sort, task dispatch\n2. 绑定与优先级: static binding, dynamic binding, priority scheduling, latency-critical, barrier management\n3. 异步与资源感知: asynchronous execution, callback-driven, dependency resolution, resource-aware scheduling, SM occupancy monitoring, memory-aware dispatch\n4. SLO与硬件: SLO-aware, tail latency, P99 latency, energy efficiency SLO, CUDA stream, CUDA event\n5. NPU/TPU调度: NPU task descriptor queue, TPU device-side scheduling, warp shuffle, barrier instruction, collective permute\n6. 硬件交互: command processor, DMA engine, hardware command queue\n\nLet me search each group across the four directories.","signature":"9d4c72e6-d99f-4e2a-8f4f-67901a2e4685"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":25880,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4217c8aa-6cae-415d-a3e5-a9267134ef9a","uuid":"b38ff129-229f-48a7-ba1f-e59f0c606180"}
