wards Resource\",\"offset\":1765}],\"excerpt\":\"- **与orchestration配合**：scale-up前需通过hazard-aware orchestration（见独立条目）的budget检查，可能被reject或compromise\\n- **Underestimation处理**：尽管有watermark和Ō估计，极少数情况下output远超预期→触发二次scale-up尝试→若失败则evict最长headroom请求并reschedule\\n涉及论文标题：\\n- Towards Resource-Efficient Serverless LLM Inference with SLINFER\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Post-Training Quantization (PTQ _ 训练后量化).md\",\"basename\":\"Post-Training Quantization (PTQ _ 训练后量化)\",\"score\":18.671581286761207,\"foundWords\":[\"resource\",\"resource-efficient\",\"aware\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"aware\",\"offset\":1377},{\"match\":\"Resource-efficient\",\"offset\":2166}],\"excerpt\":\"AWQ（Activation-aware Weight Quantization）的关键改进：观察 activation 分布而非 weight 大小来决定哪些权重重要。通过 per-channel scaling factor $s$ 保护~1% salient weights：\\n$$s^* = \\\\arg\\\\min_s \\\\|\\\\| Q(W \\\\cdot \\\\text{diag}(s)) \\\\cdot \\\\text{diag}(s)^{-1} X - WX \\\\|\\\\|$$\\nSmoothQuant（Weight-Activation Co-Quantization）：利用 activation 不同 channel 的相似性，通过 p…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MoE-based LoRA (LoRA-MoE _ Mixture of LoRA Experts _ MoLE).md\",\"basename\":\"MoE-based LoRA (LoRA-MoE _ Mixture of LoRA Experts _ MoLE)\",\"score\":16.92559003095306,\"foundWords\":[\"resource\",\"resource-efficient\",\"aware\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\")：resource-efficie\",\"offset\":2461},{\"match\":\"t-awa\",\"offset\":2638}],\"excerpt\":\"- **MixLoRA** (Li et al., 2024)：resource-efficient sparse MoE，top-k routing + load balance loss\\n  - **MOELoRA** (Liu et al., 2023)：面向 multi-task medical applications\\n  - **MiLoRA** (Zhang et al., 2024)：prompt-aware routing 降低延迟\\n  - **OMoE** (Feng et al., 2025)：orthogonal fine-tuning 强制 expert 多样性\\n  - **LoRAMoE** (Dou et al., 202…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Accelerator Unit Variations (AUV).md\",\"basename\":\"Accelerator Unit Variations (AUV)\",\"score\":16.621550148582436,\"foundWords\":[\"resource\",\"aware\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Resource\",\"offset\":496},{\"match\":\"resource\",\"offset\":662},{\"match\":\"aware\",\"offset\":1135},{\"match\":\"aware\",\"offset\":1197},{\"match\":\"aware\",\"offset\":1257},{\"match\":\"resource\",\"offset\":1291}],\"excerpt\":\"…发TDP-based频率降频，prefill→2.5GHz, decode→3.1GHz，不同AU使用率的core混合共享时频率干扰不稳定；(3) **Variation-3: Dissimilar Resource Bound** (微架构层)——AU的微架构资源需求与传统功能单元不同，AU frontend bound极低(1%)但backend bound高(prefill 92%)，不同AU使用率下LLC/memory bandwidth亲和性变化大。\\n从系统架构角度拆解术语：\\nAUV使AUV-oblivious resource managers失效的流程：\\n1. **SMT sharing fails**：AU application性能因memory contention degradation >200%，co-running OLAP slowdown >40%（Fi…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Spatial Multiplexing _ Temporal Multiplexing (GPU Concurrency Strategies).md\",\"basename\":\"Spatial Multiplexing _ Temporal Multiplexing (GPU Concurrency Strategies)\",\"score\":15.128173740340328,\"foundWords\":[\"resource\",\"aware\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"resource\",\"offset\":270},{\"match\":\"resource\",\"offset\":852},{\"match\":\"resource\",\"offset\":1395},{\"match\":\"aware\",\"offset\":2011}],\"excerpt\":\"- **Spatial Multiplexing**：将 GPU 的 SM（空间资源）划分给不同应用，多应用 **同时在** 不同 SM（或同一 SM 的不同 resource partition）上并行执行。代表机制：Priority Streams（同进程）、MPS（跨进程）。优势是提高资源利用率（非限制性资源不再空闲），代价是 SM 内资源竞争（L1 cache/functional unit/warp scheduler contention）可能导致 performance degradation 和不可预测性。\\n- **Temporal Multiplexing**：通过时间分片将 GPU 整体轮流分配给不同应用，**任何时候只有一个应用**占有 GPU。代表机制：Time-Slicing（跨进程）。优势是隔离性好、predictable…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Image-Driven Burst in Production LMM Traffic.md\",\"basename\":\"Image-Driven Burst in Production LMM Traffic\",\"score\":15.099177437400874,\"foundWords\":[\"resource\",\"aware\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"aware\",\"offset\":1048},{\"match\":\"Aware\",\"offset\":1306},{\"match\":\"Resource\",\"offset\":1312}],\"excerpt\":\"ModServe 使用 token-aware autoscaling（基于 image tokens/sec）应对 image-driven burst。此术语解释了为什么纯 text-centric LLM serving 优化（如 PD disaggregation）不足以应对 multimodal workloads——multimodal burst 的本质是 modality-specific 的，需要 modality-specific 的响应机制。\\n涉及论文标题：\\n- ModServe: Modality- and Stage-Aware Resource Disaggregation for Scalable…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Query-Centric vs KV-Centric Attention Execution（面向查询 vs 面向KV缓存的注意力执行）.md\",\"basename\":\"Query-Centric vs KV-Centric Attention Execution（面向查询 vs 面向KV缓存的注意力执行）\",\"score\":14.486116906210544,\"foundWords\":[\"resource\",\"aware\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Aware\",\"offset\":1884},{\"match\":\"Aware\",\"offset\":3131},{\"match\":\"Resource\",\"offset\":3152}],\"excerpt\":\"**PAT (Memory-Centric Prefix-Aware)**:\\n```\\n// 动态CTA partitioning + multi-tile\\nCTA_0: Q1, Q2 share KV-0, KV-1, KV-3 → tile (32, 128) for q=2, kv_len~=long\\nCTA_1: Q3, Q4 share KV-0, KV-2 → tile (32, 64) for q=2, kv_len~=medium\\nCTA_2: Q1 finish KV-6, Q2 finish KV-7 → tile (32, 32) for q=2, kv_len=short\\nCTA_3: Q3 finish KV-4, Q4 fi…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multimodal Connector _ Modality-Alignment Module.md\",\"basename\":\"Multimodal Connector _ Modality-Alignment Module\",\"score\":14.402111941802257,\"foundWords\":[\"resource\",\"aware\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Aware\",\"offset\":869},{\"match\":\"Resource\",\"offset\":875}],\"excerpt\":\"- ModServe: Modality- and Stage-Aware Resource Disaggregation for Scalable Multimodal Model Serving\\n---\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Stage Disaggregation for Multimodal Serving.md\",\"basename\":\"Stage Disaggregation for Multimodal Serving\",\"score\":14.392706896234419,\"foundWords\":[\"resource\",\"aware\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Aware\",\"offset\":632},{\"match\":\"Aware\",\"offset\":2040},{\"match\":\"Resource\",\"offset\":2046}],\"excerpt\":\"请求到达 → Modality-Aware Router:\\n  ├─ Text-only request → 直接路由到 Text Pool Manager\\n  └─ Image-text request → Image Pool Manager 分配 Image Instance\\nImage Instance (独立资源池):\\n  CPU: numactl-pinned image preprocessing\\n  GPU (TP-1): ViT enco