AG流水线。核心理念：利用LLM computation graph的确定性拓扑顺序（parameters按layer顺序访问），将参数restoration操作（CMA allocation、flash I/O、AES decryption）与CPU/NPU computation重叠执行，把restoration latency隐藏到computation latency下。配合priority-based greedy scheduling、preemptive micro-operator scheduling和partial parameter caching，使…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md\",\"basename\":\"Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation\",\"score\":60.02726500113472,\"foundWords\":[\"micro\",\"operator\",\"operator切分为tile/micro\",\"operator切分为tile\",\"operators，为每个tile生成多种ilp/tlp/arithmetic\",\"operators\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"operator切分为tile/micro\",\"offset\":124},{\"match\":\"operators，为每个tile生成多种ILP/TLP/arithmetic\",\"offset\":146},{\"match\":\"micro\",\"offset\":208},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":658},{\"match\":\"micro\",\"offset\":669},{\"match\":\"operators\",\"offset\":675},{\"match\":\"operators\",\"offset\":705},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":726}],\"excerpt\":\"Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation是Infera compiler的核心编译策略：将DNN operator切分为tile/micro operators，为每个tile生成多种ILP/TLP/arithmetic intensity trade-off配置的micro-kernel candidates，编译过程完全基于静态分析（资源约束、instruction scheduling、warp specialization），无需GPU profiling或性能模型评估（zero-tuning）。相比Ansor/MetaSchedule的搜索式编译（2-3个数量级的编译时间差异），zero-tuning通过固定数值化配置直接生成高质量kernel。\\n从编译框架角度拆解术语，比如术…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/PIT (Permutation Invariant Transformation) for MoE.md\",\"basename\":\"PIT (Permutation Invariant Transformation) for MoE\",\"score\":47.30009909688747,\"foundWords\":[\"micro\",\"micro_tiles\",\"micro-tiles\",\"operator\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"e micro-til\",\"offset\":252},{\"match\":\"e\\nmicro_til\",\"offset\":297},{\"match\":\"e(micro_til\",\"offset\":388},{\"match\":\"明 operat\",\"offset\":593}],\"excerpt\":\"# PIT Tiling: sparse micro-tiles -> dense tile -> GEMM -> inverse\\nmicro_tiles = extract_per_expert_tiles(input_tokens, tile_size)\\ndense_tile = pit_rearrange(micro_tiles)      # 置换不变性保证等价\\nresult = dense_gemm(dense_tile, merged_W)     # high GPU utilization\\noutput = pit_inverse_rearrange(result)         # 恢复原始顺序\\n```\\n术语…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Expert Parallelism.md\",\"basename\":\"Expert Parallelism\",\"score\":37.77716288908772,\"foundWords\":[\"micro\",\"micro-op\",\"operator\",\"operator重新分类\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":497},{\"match\":\"operator重新分类\",\"offset\":514},{\"match\":\"micro-op\",\"offset\":3001},{\"match\":\"micro-op\",\"offset\":3029}],\"excerpt\":\"- Intra-operator + Inter-operator重新分类：Alpa\\n- MoDa（MoE Parallism + Data Parallelism）：BaGuaLu\\n从系统架构角度拆解术语。\\n以Tutel的自适应并行策略为例，一个MoE层的端到端执行：\\n1. **输入准备**：batch tokens分布在各GPU上，每GPU持有全部非expert参数\\n2. **本地计算**：每GPU对本地token执行Attention + Router → 得到每个token的expert选择\\n3. **All-to-All Dispatch**：Router输出决定token的目标GPU → NCC…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Irregular All-to-All (All-to-Allv) for MoE Partitioning.md\",\"basename\":\"Irregular All-to-All (All-to-Allv) for MoE Partitioning\",\"score\":36.6900435533057,\"foundWords\":[\"micro\",\"micro-batch，每个\",\"micro-batch\",\"operator\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"micro-batch，每个\",\"offset\":248},{\"match\":\"micro-batch\",\"offset\":263},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":391}],\"excerpt\":\"…是 MoE 分布式训练中的通信模式，其中每个设备向不同目标设备发送不同数量的数据（非均匀 partition）。在 Lancet 的算子分区方案中，input batch 沿 batch 维度分区为 micro-batch，每个 micro-batch 经过 gating 后，向某个 expert 发送的 token 数从 0 到 C（expert capacity）不等，但所有 partition 的总 token 数之和等于 C。这种不规则性源于：special gating operator 在 partition 间传递容量信息——当第一个 partition 使用 3/4 C 容量时，后续 partition 动态调整 remaining capacity 为 1/4 C。Lancet 使用双趟 All-to-All 实现：第一趟交换各 GPU 间实际传输的 data size，…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Pipeline Bubble.md\",\"basename\":\"Pipeline Bubble\",\"score\":36.295740511225134,\"foundWords\":[\"micro\",\"micro-batching\",\"micro-batch\",\"operator\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Micro-batch\",\"offset\":418},{\"match\":\"micro-batching\",\"of