{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Publisher-Subscriber Architecture for MoE Expert Offloading（异步发布-订阅专家预取）.md\",\"basename\":\"Publisher-Subscriber Architecture for MoE Expert Offloading（异步发布-订阅专家预取）\",\"score\":30.188849111755083,\"foundWords\":[\"latency\",\"latency-memory\",\"latency。\",\"critical\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"critical\",\"offset\":1546},{\"match\":\"latency\",\"offset\":1707},{\"match\":\"latency。\",\"offset\":2096},{\"match\":\"Latency-Memory\",\"offset\":2123}],\"excerpt\":\"- Map searching + prefetching overhead 不进入 inference critical path\\n- GPU task pool 异步线程调度 prefetch/on-demand loading\\n- Expert miss 时暂停所有 pending prefetch → 立即 on-demand load → 恢复 prefetch\\n- Overhead < 1% iteration latency (< 50ms for all non-async ops)\\n术语一般如何实现？如何使用？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nFineMoE 中 Expert Map Store 用 PyTorch/NumPy ndarray 实现 broker 功能。异步执行通…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Data Preprocessing Operators in Recommendation Systems.md\",\"basename\":\"Data Preprocessing Operators in Recommendation Systems\",\"score\":28.487029273189172,\"foundWords\":[\"latency直接影响end\",\"latency直接影响end-to-end\",\"critical\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"critical\",\"offset\":183},{\"match\":\"latency直接影响end-to-end\",\"offset\":2036}],\"excerpt\":\"…g Operators是推荐系统推理pipeline中的前置数据转换算子族，负责将raw features转换为model-ready inputs，在model inference的latency-critical path上同步执行。KernelEvolve论文识别的三类核心preprocessing transformation：(1) Dense normalization——BoxCox/Logit统计变换、one-hot encoding、linear scaling (shift + multiplication)；(2) Sparse processing——top-k selection with truncation、cryptographic hashing mapping IDs to embedding table indices、type downcasting…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/ASTRA-SIM (Distributed DL Communication Simulator).md\",\"basename\":\"ASTRA-SIM (Distributed DL Communication Simulator)\",\"score\":28.221292946368912,\"foundWords\":[\"latency\",\"latency,\",\"critical\",\"critical_path\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"latency,\",\"offset\":815},{\"match\":\"critical_path\",\"offset\":1084},{\"match\":\"latency,\",\"offset\":1462}],\"excerpt\":\"Topology: GPU count, NVLink bandwidth per link, latency, switch hierarchy\\n  Workload: collective list [(type, size, participants), ...]\\nSimulate per collective:\\n  Select algorithm (ring/tree/hierarchical) based on topology+size\\n  Compute per-hop delay = chunk_size / link_bandwidth\\n  Aggregate total_comm_time = max(critical_path)\\n  Compute achiev…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Expert Activation-Aware Placement (Co-activation Minimization).md\",\"basename\":\"Expert Activation-Aware Placement (Co-activation Minimization)\",\"score\":25.341298718139072,\"foundWords\":[\"latency\",\"latency。核心观察：当两个\",\"critical\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"latency。核心观察：当两个\",\"offset\":201},{\"match\":\"latency\",\"offset\":351},{\"match\":\"critica\",\"offset\":1836}],\"excerpt\":\"Expert Activation-Aware Placement 是 JANUS 提出的 expert replica 放置策略，目标是 minimize MoE layer latency。核心观察：当两个 expert 经常被同一 batch 的 tokens 同时激活（即 co-activated），将它们放在同一 MoE GPU 上会增加该 GPU 的 distinct activated expert 计数 a_max，从而增加 MoE 执行延迟（因为 MoE latency ∝ a_max）。\\nJANUS 将 placement 形式化为 min-max 优化问题 (Eq. 7, Appendix B)：\\n$$\\n\\\\min_{\\\\{x_{e,g}\\\\}} \\\\max_{g} I(g) = \\\\min_{\\\\{x_{e,g}\\\\}} \\\\max_{g} \\\\sum_{e,…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Asynchronous Expert Prefetching in GPU Task Pool（GPU 异步专家预取任务池）.md\",\"basename\":\"Asynchronous Expert Prefetching in GPU Task Pool（GPU 异步专家预取任务池）\",\"score\":24.53824734645462,\"foundWords\":[\"latency\",\"latency-memory\",\"critical\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"latency\",\"offset\":2080},{\"match\":\"critical\",\"offset\":2093},{\"match\":\"latency\",\"offset\":2153},{\"match\":\"critical\",\"offset\":2165},{\"match\":\"critical\",\"offset\":2604},{\"match\":\"Latency-Memory\",\"offset\":2641}],\"excerpt\":\"- MoE-Infinity: 每层 forward 前同步等待 expert prediction + prefetch → prefetch latency 直接加在 critical path\\n- FineMoE: forwar