/kernel知识笔记/FlashInfer Attention Kernel（FlashInfer 注意力计算库）.md\",\"basename\":\"FlashInfer Attention Kernel（FlashInfer 注意力计算库）\",\"score\":20.961376002434058,\"foundWords\":[\"latency\",\"latency-throughput\",\"criticality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Criticality\",\"offset\":2793},{\"match\":\"Latency-Throughput\",\"offset\":3194}],\"excerpt\":\"在 Quest 中，FlashInfer 被扩展了三个自定义 CUDA kernel：(a) Criticality estimation kernel——利用 per-page min/max Key metadata 与 Query 向量计算 upper-bound attention score；(b) Top-K filtering——调用 RAFT batched Top-K CUDA operator 选择关键 page；(c) Approximate attention——基于 PageAttention sparse page loading，仅对选中 page 执行 FlashAttention。RTX 4090 上 32K seq_len, 2048 token b…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module-Based Batching（模块级批处理）.md\",\"basename\":\"Module-Based Batching（模块级批处理）\",\"score\":19.9796327104981,\"foundWords\":[\"latency\",\"latency-sensitive\",\"critical\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"下的 late\",\"offset\":2115},{\"match\":\"估算 criti\",\"offset\":2197},{\"match\":\"ve/latency-sensit\",\"offset\":2330}],\"excerpt\":\"- **Batch size 搜索**：offline profiling 各模块在不同 batch size 和 sequence length 下的 latency 和 peak memory，然后在搜索空间（B, b_a, b_e, ω, S_Expert, S_Params）中枚举，通过 DAG+DP 估算 critical path 选择吞吐最优配置。\\n- **适用场景**：offline high-throughput inference（benchmarking、data wrangling、feature extraction），不适合 interactive/latency-sensitive 场景（首 token 延迟高）。需要足够的 host memory 存储完整模型 + KV-cache（如 DeepSeek-V…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Expert-wise CPU Optimization (专家级CPU优化器 _ Streaming CPU Optimizer).md\",\"basename\":\"Expert-wise CPU Optimization (专家级CPU优化器 _ Streaming CPU Optimizer)\",\"score\":14.675474574641283,\"foundWords\":[\"latency\",\"critical\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"latency\",\"offset\":1434},{\"match\":\"critical\",\"offset\":2769}],\"excerpt\":\"End-to-end: CPU Adam latency ~hidden by GPU backward of preceding layers\\n```\\n伪代码：\\n```python\\ndef expert_wise_cpu_optimization(layer_backward_graph):\\n    for lay