sed Triton Kernel for MoE Router Post-Processing.md","basename":"Fused Triton Kernel for MoE Router Post-Processing","score":14.362003449496118,"foundWords":["latency","critical"],"matches":[{"match":"critical","offset":170},{"match":"latency","offset":5738}],"excerpt":"Fused Triton Kernel for MoE Router Post-Processing 是 LYNX 用于在 MoE 推理的 critical path 中高效执行 batch 级 expert selection 的 GPU kernel 实现。LYNX 将 confidence analysis、adaptive expert scoring、expert pruning 和 expert remapping 四个步骤融合为 4 个 Triton kernel，替代原本需要超过 700 个 PyTorch 小算子的 naive implementation。\n四个 kernel 的分工：\n1. **Kernel 1 (Token-wise Binning)**：对 batch 中所有 token 并行计算 lo…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hierarchical Roofline Model (HRM) for MoE Inference (MoE推理的层次Roofline模型).md","basename":"Hierarchical Roofline Model (HRM) for MoE Inference (MoE推理的层次Roofline模型)","score":14.29681154849975,"foundWords":["latency","critical"],"matches":[{"match":"critical","offset":705},{"match":"latency","offset":1913}],"excerpt":"HRM 引入两个 Turning Points 和一个 Balance Point：(1) $P_1$ (Eq. 9)——当 $I_x^j$ 低于 $P_1$ 的 critical intensity 时，不值得将数据从 CPU 传输到 GPU 计算，应就地计算（例如 decode attention 在 CPU 执行）；(2) $P_2$ (Eq. 10)——低于此 intensity 时系统受限于 PCIe 带宽，需增大 batch size 或静态放置部分 weights；(3) Balance Point (Eq. 11)——$B_{peak}^i \\times I_x^i = B_{peak}^{j,i} \\times I_x^j$，GPU BW 与 PCIe BW 达到平衡，资源利用最大化。\n例如：Mixtral 8x7B decode a…"}],"totalCount":20,"truncated":false},"effectiveQuery":"static binding dynamic binding priority scheduling latency-critical path:knowledge_notes"}}}
