{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_NJBwOOe5bcXx11GFoSRM4440","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /data3/paper_analysis/learning_outputs/20260529_185938__MoEDiT多模态Video__单GPUNPU加速器__多算子微算子并发__硬件体系结构/Q2.4_L2_answer.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4217c8aa-6cae-415d-a3e5-a9267134ef9a","uuid":"04cbf23c-cac4-4e0a-ada7-bbb9748a3ab8","timestamp":"2026-05-30T19:20:07.872Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"/data3/paper_analysis/learning_outputs/20260529_185938__MoEDiT多模态Video__单GPUNPU加速器__多算子微算子并发__硬件体系结构/Q2.4_L2_answer.md","content":"# Q2.4 — 面向单请求内微算子并发的 Dispatcher 设计关键方法和策略\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/1-Towards High-Goodput LLM Serving with Prefill-decode Multiplexing/3.4-SLO-aware-Dispatcher.md | 5286.6 | SLO-aware Dispatcher: decode优先 + prefill填空 + 动态SM分区 + 抢占策略 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/ACS Concurrent Kernel Execution on Irregular, Input-Dependent Computational Graphs/D.-Key-Observations.md | 2441.0 | ACS 乱序kernel调度: 运行时依赖检测 + 调度窗口 + ACS-SW/HW双实现 |\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/4-QoServe Breaking the Silos of LLM Inference Serving/span-idpage-3-0span3-QoServe-Design-and-Implementation.md | 3756.4 | Hybrid Prioritization (EDF+SRPF插值) + Eager Relegation + Dynamic Chunking |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (Multi-GPU).md | 556.8 | 三维资源感知调度: threads/registers/shared memory 评估 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Pipelined Parameter Restoration.md | 141.3 | Priority-based greedy + preemptive micro-operator (~64KB) + DAG pipeline |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Dynamic SM Repartitioning（动态SM重分区）.md | 46.3 | Bullet: 微秒级SM重分区 (~4.1μs), SLO-aware repartition command |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Prefill-Decode Multiplexing (PDM).md | 13.4 | GreenContext SM分区 + Decode优先 + Prefill填空 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Shepherd Operator.md | 658.1 | 小operator合并抽象: scheduling granularity优化 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Arithmetic Intensity-Aware PIM-GPU Operator Scheduling（算术强度感知的PIM-GPU算子调度）.md | 333.5 | CI-based动态operator-to-device映射, PIM ridge point比较 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Spatial Multiplexing _ Temporal Multiplexing (GPU Concurrency Strategies).md | 15.1 | GPU并发策略: spatial vs temporal multiplexing, MPS/streams/libsmctrl |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Fine-Grained SLO-Aware Resource Scaling.md | 454.2 | JANUS: 二维(n_a, n_e)优化, Monte Carlo lookup table, TPOT SLO约束 |\n| experiment_notes/编译实验笔记/Automated End-to-End Model Serving with Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling.md | 95.5 | Infera compiler: tile-based partition + shepherd operator + multi-version kernel |\n| experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/Automated End-to-End Model Serving with Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling.md | 59.0 | Infera runtime: SelectKernels DAG G(u) metric + FuseKernels warp-level + LaunchKernel CDP daemon |\n| experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/MPipeMoE_ Memory Efficient MoE for Pre-trained Models with Adaptive Pipeline Parallelism.md | 56.3 | MPipeMoE: multi-CUDA-stream micro-batch pipeline + interference profiling |\n| experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/TZ-LLM_ Protecting On-Device Large Language Models with Arm TrustZone.md | 187.6 | TZ-LLM: CPU+NPU co-driver调度, priority-based greedy + preemptive micro-operator |\n| idea_notes/Automated End-to-End Model Serving with Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling.md | 117.3 | Infera tile-level DAG调度: operator→micro-operator切分, downstream tile early start |\n| idea_notes/TZ-LLM_ Protecting On-Device Large Language Models with Arm TrustZone.md | 116.4 | TZ-LLM: operator队列→computation优先→alloc/decrypt切为micro-operator可抢占 |\n\n---\n\n## 一、方法细节：Dispatcher 核心架构与硬件映射\n\n### 方法1: SLO-Aware Dispatcher with Dynamic SM Repartitioning (MuxWise + Bullet)\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/1-Towards High-Goodput LLM Serving with Prefill-decode Multiplexing/3.4-SLO-aware-Dispatcher.md` (score: 5286.6), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Dynamic SM Repartitioning（动态SM重分区）.md` (score: 46.3)\n\n**方法细节** — Dispatcher 调度流程伪代码（L2 框架模拟）：\n\n```\n// ===== MuxWise SLO-Aware Dispatcher 单次迭代 =====\n// 运行平台: 单GPU (A100/H100), SGLang 0.4.10post2 + GreenContext\n// 输入: prefill_queue, decode_batch, SLO target (TBT: 50ms/100ms)\n// 输出: SM分区配置 + 发射的prefill/decode batch\n\nFunction SLO_AWARE_DISPATCH(prefill_queue, decode_batch, SLO_TBT):\n    // Step 1: Decode SLO优先 — 计算decode所需最小SM数\n    T_d = ContentionTolerantEstimator.estimate_decode(\n        decode_batch.size, avg_seq_len, kv_cache_size)\n    \n    // Step 2: 确定SM分区 (通过GreenContext API)\n    // A100: 108 SM → 6种配置 (每16 SM粒度); H100: 132 SM → 7种配置\n    SM_decode = ceil((T_d / SLO_TBT) * total_SMs)\n    SM_decode = min(SM_decode, total_SMs * 0.8)  // 上界保护\n    SM_prefill = total_SMs - SM_decode\n    \n    // Step 3: 分配SM给两个GreenContext\n    libsmctrl_set_stream_mask(stream_decode, build_mask(0, SM_decode))\n    libsmctrl_set_stream_mask(stream_prefill, build_mask(SM_decode, SM_prefill))\n    // 重分区耗时: ~4.1μs on A100\n    \n    // Step 4: 计算prefill layer数 (layer-wise multiplexing)\n    T_P = ContentionTolerantEstimator.estimate_prefill_layer(\n        prefill_batch.tokens, SM_prefill)\n    N_PL = ceil((T_d * N_layers) / T_P)  // 此次发射的prefill层数\n    \n    // Step 5: 发射并行执行\n    launch_async(decode_kernel, stream_decode, all_decode_tokens)\n    launch_async(prefill_layers[0:N_PL], stream_prefill, prefill_tokens)\n    \n    // Step 6: Prefill完成→合并到decode batch\n    cudaStreamSynchronize(stream_prefill)\n    decode_batch.merge(completed_prefill_tokens)  // batch_size 增大\n    \n    // Step 7 (可选): Prefill Preemption\n    if new_prefill.has_tight_TTFT and active_prefill.will_miss_SLO():\n        preempt(active_prefill)  // 不递归抢占\n        schedule(new_prefill)\n```\n\n**SLO-aware Repartition 决策逻辑（Bullet 风格动态SM重分区）**:\n\n```\n// 每个prefill layer group或decode step后触发\nstate = read_shared_metadata_buffer()  // p90_tpot, queue_depth, current_sm_split\n\nif state.p90_tpot > TPOT_SLO * 0.9:\n    // decode近SLO边界 → 移SM给decode\n    new_sm_decode = state.sm_decode + 16\nelif state.prefill_queue_depth > threshold AND state.p90_tpot < TPOT_SLO * 0.7:\n    // prefill堆积且decode有余量 → 移SM给prefill\n    new_sm_prefill = state.sm_prefill + 16\n\nresource_manager.repartition(new_sm_prefill, new_sm_decode)\n// 内部: libsmctrl_set_stream_mask() → 后续kernel自动在新SM子集上执行\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **SM分区粒度**: 16 SM/步, A100上6种配置, H100上7种配置。太粗则响应迟钝, 太细则频繁切换开销大\n- **GreenContext vs MPS vs MIG**: GreenContext (CUDA 12.4+) 支持进程内SM分区, 比MPS更轻量, 比MIG更灵活（不需要重启GPU）\n- **Contention Tolerant Estimator**: 关键组件——建模HBM带宽竞争（prefill和decode共享HBM通道），为decode提供worst-case slowdown因子，确保decode SLO不被prefill干扰\n- **硬件依赖**: 依赖NVIDIA SM mask机制（通过libsmctrl/GreenContext API操作硬件寄存器），非开源GPU无法直接移植到NPU。NPU对应机制为task descriptor queue的优先级抢占（笔记未明确说明NPU等价API）\n- **Preemption约束**: 不递归抢占——短请求抢占长请求后不可再被抢占（避免级联SLO miss）\n\n---\n\n### 方法2: Priority-Based Greedy + Preemptive Micro-Operator Scheduling (TZ-LLM)\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Pipelined Parameter Restoration.md` (score: 141.3), `experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/TZ-LLM_ Protecting On-Device Large Language Models with Arm TrustZone.md` (score: 187.6)\n\n**方法细节** — DAG扩展 + Priority Scheduler 框架模拟：\n\n```\n// ===== TZ-LLM Dispatcher: 四种Operator DAG + Priority Greedy =====\n// 运行平台: RK3588 (4×A76 + 4×A55 + 3-core NPU ~6 TOPS)\n// Operator类型: ALLOC, LOAD, DECRYPT, COMPUTE\n\n// Step 1: 编译期 — DAG构建\n扩展Computation Graph:\n  for layer_idx in topological_order:\n      comp_op = original_graph[layer_idx]  // 原始compute operator\n      // 每个compute前插入3类restoration operator\n      alloc_op = AllocOp(layer_idx, param_size)    // CMA内存分配\n      load_op  = LoadOp(layer_idx, param_size)     // Flash I/O读取\n      decr_op  = DecrOp(layer_idx, param_size)     // AES解密\n      // 层内依赖: alloc → load → decr → comp\n      // 跨层无依赖: comp[layer_i] 可与 {alloc,load,decr}[layer_{i+1}] 重叠\n\n// Step 2: 运行时 — Priority-based Greedy Scheduler\nready_queue = PriorityQueue()  // 按优先级排序\n\nwhile has_pending_operators():\n    ready_queue.update()  // 扫描DAG, 加入依赖已满足的operators\n    \n    if ready_queue.has(COMPUTE):\n        op = ready_queue.pop_highest_priority()  // COMPUTE优先级最高\n    else:\n        earliest_comp = find_earliest_comp_in_dag()  // 拓扑序最早的compute\n        op = get_associated_restoration(earliest_comp)\n        // 优先为即将到来的compute准备参数\n    \n    execute(op)\n\n// Step 3: Preemptive Micro-Operator 机制\n// 大alloc/decrypt (>64KB) 被切分为 ~64KB micro-ops\n// CPU computation就绪时 → 抢占当前micro-op → 插入compute\n// 抢占后恢复: alloc_micro_op.resume_from_checkpoint()\n\n// 执行时序示例 (Llama-3-8B, 512-token prompt):\n// Layer0: [Alloc0][Load0][Decrypt0]======[Compute0]==========\n// Layer1:          [Alloc1][Load1][Decrypt1]======[Compute1]==\n// Layer2:                   [Alloc2][Load2][Decrypt2]=========\n//         ← restoration latency被隐藏到computation latency下 →\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **Operator类型与硬件映射**: COMPUTE → NPU (3-core, ~6 TOPS) 或 CPU (A76大核); LOAD → Flash I/O (NVMe SSD); DECRYPT → CPU AES (OpenSSL); ALLOC → CPU CMA API\n- **抢占粒度**: ~64KB micro-operator — 在RK3588 LPDDR4X (约25 GB/s带宽) 下每次micro-op约 2.5μs。抢占开销为保存/恢复状态寄存器 + TZASC重配置\n- **Pipeline效率**: 距critical path lower bound仅 0.01%-9.9% (笔记显示)\n- **NPU Co-Driver设计**: REE driver负责scheduling/power/frequency (control plane); TEE data plane driver负责secure job context/MMIO launch/interrupt completion。Shadow job机制使secure job可入统一队列\n- **Single-Request适用性**: 该方法天然为单请求设计 — 整个DAG服务于单一LLM推理请求的prefill+decode全流程\n\n---\n\n### 方法3: ACS — Out-of-Order Kernel Dispatch with Runtime Dependency Resolution\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/ACS Concurrent Kernel Execution on Irregular, Input-Dependent Computational Graphs/D.-Key-Observations.md` (score: 2441.0)\n\n**方法细节** — Hardware-Assisted 调度窗口 框架模拟:\n\n```\n// ===== ACS: Runtime Out-of-Order Kernel Dispatch =====\n// 核心思想: 模仿CPU乱序执行 — 在GPU Command Processor中维护调度窗口,\n//          运行时检测kernel间数据依赖, 标记就绪kernel并发发射\n\n// === ACS-SW (纯软件实现) ===\n// 数据结构\nInput_FIFO:     queue<kernel_metadata>    // 应用层调用的kernel队列\nSchedulingWindow: fixed[N] slots {         // N=32~64\n    kernel_id, state ∈ {READY, PENDING, EXECUTING},\n    upstream_list: [kernel_id],            // 依赖的上游kernel\n    read_segments:  [(start_addr, size)],  // 读内存段\n    write_segments: [(start_addr, size)]   // 写内存段\n}\n\n// 多线程调度器\nThread_WindowModule:  // 管理窗口 + 依赖检测\n    loop:\n        // 1. 从Input FIFO取kernel入窗口\n        if SW.has_vacancy() and FIFO.not_empty():\n            kernel = FIFO.pop()\n            // 依赖检测 (Algorithm 1)\n            for each sw_kernel in SW:\n                if overlap(kernel.write_segments, sw_kernel.read_segments) OR\n                   overlap(kernel.write_segments, sw_kernel.write_segments):\n                    kernel.upstream_list.append(sw_kernel.id)\n                    kernel.state = PENDING\n            SW.insert(kernel)  // 无依赖→READY; 有依赖→PENDING\n        \n        // 2. 当kernel完成时更新窗口\n        on_kernel_complete(kernel_id):\n            for each sw_kernel in SW:\n                sw_kernel.upstream_list.remove(kernel_id)\n                if sw_kernel.upstream_list.empty():\n                    sw_kernel.state = READY\n\nThread_SchedulerModule:  // N_threads, 每个绑定1个CUDA stream\n    loop:\n        if my_stream.empty():\n            ready_kernel = SW.poll_ready()  // 从窗口取READY kernel\n            launch(ready_kernel, my_stream)\n            cudaStreamSynchronize(my_stream)  // 等待完成→触发窗口更新\n\n// === ACS-HW (硬件加速) ===\n// 硬件调度窗口 (GPU Command Processor内)\n// 结构: N slots × [(N-1)×8B upstream IDs + 2bit state] SRAM\n// N=32 → ~1KB SRAM (全GPU)\n\nHardware_Scheduling_Window:  // GPU侧\n    // 插入: CPU发kernel+upstream list → HW窗口\n    // 更新: kernel完成 → HW遍历所有slot, 移除对应upstream ID\n    //        → 某slot upstream为空 → 标记READY → 发射到dispatch unit\n    // 延迟: N=64时 ~64 cycles (~50-100ns) overhead\n    \n    // CPU维护scheduled_list (可stale, 最大M条)\n    // 插入新kernel前用scheduled_list做初筛依赖 → 减少HW窗口误判\n    // upstream_load_module防止scheduled_list遗漏长running kernel\n```\n\n**多流 vs DAG vs ACS 对比**:\n```\n// 传统单流 (顺序执行, GPU利用率低)\nStream0: [K0][K1][K2][K3][K4][K5]  → 无并发\n\n// Multi-Stream + Event (需提前全部依赖分析, 同步开销大)\nStream0: [K0]──────→event→[K3]─────→\nStream1:    [K1]──→event→[K4]──→     ← 5-20μs sync overhead/event\nStream2:       [K2]──────→[K5]→\n\n// ACS (运行时窗口调度, 无CPU同步, 乱序发射)\nScheduling Window (N=4):\n  T0: [K0:R][K1:P(K0)][K2:P(K0,K1)][K3:R]  → 发射K0, K3\n  T1: [K1:R][K2:P(K1)][K4:P(K3)][K5:R]      → 发射K1, K5\n  T2: [K2:R][K4:R][K6:P(K5)][K7:P(K4,K6)]    → 发射K2, K4\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **硬件调度窗口 vs CPU调度**: ACS-HW消除CPU-GPU同步（无StreamSync），kernel完成事件在GPU内部处理。对单请求微算子场景，调度窗口大小N=32~64足以覆盖一层MoE或DiT step内的算子数\n- **依赖检测开销**: CPU侧scheduled_list fit in cache (~4KB)，依赖检测 compute-bound而非memory-bound。对N=32窗口，segment overlap检测 < 1μs\n- **适用场景**: ACS特别适合input-dependent irregular DAG（如动态路由MoE、instance-aware DNN），因为在运行时才知道kernel依赖。对固定DAG（标准Transformer），传统CUDA Graph更高效\n- **硬件面积**: 1KB SRAM（N=32调度窗口），可忽略不计\n- **与GPU Command Processor交互**: ACS-HW直接修改command processor的调度逻辑——原本按队列顺序发射，现改为从调度窗口中选择READY kernel乱序发射。这是硬件-软件协同设计的关键创新点\n- **笔记未明确说明**: NPU/TPU是否有等价的command processor可修改性。NPU的task descriptor queue通常为FIFO，缺乏乱序发射硬件支持\n\n---\n\n### 方法4: Resource-Aware Multi-Dimensional Task Dispatching (HuntKTm)\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (Multi-GPU).md` (score: 556.8)\n\n**方法细节** — 三维资源感知调度算法:\n\n```\n// ===== HuntKTm Resource-Aware Dispatcher =====\n// 核心: 三维SM资源评估 → 防单一维度瓶颈 → 负载均衡\n\nFunction TASK_SCHEDULE(GPU_list G, pending_queue Q, Task T):\n    g_best = None, score_best = 0\n    \n    for each gpu in G:\n        // 维度1: Memory — free memory ≥ task需求\n        if gpu.free_memory < T.memory_requirement:\n            continue\n        // 维度2: Hardware Queue — 可用concurrent streams ≥ task需求\n        if gpu.available_hw_queues < T.stream_count:\n            continue\n        \n        // 维度3: Compute — 三维SM可用量评估\n        // 将threads/registers/shared_memory归一化到[0,1]\n        score_threads = (gpu.avail_threads + T.thread_req) / gpu.total_threads\n        score_regs    = (gpu.avail_regs    + T.reg_req)    / gpu.total_regs\n        score_shmem   = (gpu.avail_shmem   + T.shmem_req)  / gpu.total_shmem\n        \n        // 最紧张的资源维度决定score (木桶原理)\n        bottleneck = min(score_threads, score_regs, score_shmem)\n        score = gpu.total_sms - bottleneck  // SM越多 + 资源越宽松 → score越高\n        \n        if score > score_best:\n            g_best = gpu, score_best = score\n    \n    if g_best != None:\n        gpu.reserve(T)  // 预留资源\n        return g_best\n    else:\n        T.suspend_to(pending_queue)  // 挂起等待资源释放\n        return None\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **三维评估的必要性**: 不同micro-operator有不同资源瓶颈——GEMM受限于registers (large tile), attention受限于shared memory (KV tile), elementwise受限于threads。单维度评估会导致错配\n- **Hardware Queue维度**: 每个task可能占用多个CUDA stream（NVIDIA H100: 128 hardware queues; A100: 128）。HuntKTm显式管理stream分配\n- **非抢占式**: task一旦分配不迁移 — 避免micro-operator中途迁移的开销（需保存/恢复register + shared memory状态 + 跨GPU拷贝中间结果）\n- **Single-Request映射**: 单请求内多个micro-operator可视为多个task，分配到同一GPU的不同stream（空间复用）或不同GPU（如果可用）\n- **硬件依赖**: 依赖NVIDIA persistence mode减少GPU初始化开销; 依赖memory pool预分配减少运行时alloc/free\n\n---\n\n### 方法5: Hybrid Prioritization + Eager Relegation Dispatcher (QoServe)\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/4-QoServe Breaking the Silos of LLM Inference Serving/span-idpage-3-0span3-QoServe-Design-and-Implementation.md` (score: 3756.4)\n\n**方法细节** — 三队列架构 + 动态优先级插值:\n\n```\n// ===== QoServe Dispatcher: 三队列 + Hybrid Prioritization =====\n// 队列架构: Prefill Queue → Decode Queue → Relegated Queue\n\n// 优先级公式 (Hybrid = EDF + SRPF插值)\n// Interactive请求:\nP_i = t_arrival + SLO_TTFT + α × Prefill_rem_tokens\n//      ↑ EDF部分   ↑ SLO        ↑ SRPF部分 (remaining work)\n\n// Non-interactive请求:\nP_i = t_arrival + SLO_TTLT + α × (Prefill_rem + Decode_rem)\n\n// Dynamic Batch Creation (Algorithm 1)\nFunction CREATE_BATCH():\n    selected = GET_ALL_DECODES()  // 所有decode请求必入batch\n    min_slack = GET_MIN_SLACK(selected)  // decode batch的最小slack\n    C = GET_PREFILL_BUDGET(num_decodes, context, min_slack)\n    // C = 在满足decode TBT约束下最大prefill chunk\n    \n    job_queue = PRIORITY_QUEUE(COMPARATOR)  // 按P_i排序\n    prefill_tokens = 0\n    \n    while prefill_tokens < C:\n        top = job_queue.TOP\n        if WILL_VIOLATE(top):  // 已/将违反SLO\n            top.relegate()     // → relegated queue\n            job_queue.PUSH(top)\n            continue\n        \n        take = min(C - prefill_tokens, top.rem_tokens)\n        prefill_tokens += take\n        selected.APPEND(top)\n        job_queue.POP()\n    \n    PROCESS_BATCH(selected)  // fused prefill+decode attention\n\n// Relegation策略:\n// - 主动relegate已violate或即将violate的请求\n// - Multi-tenant: free-tier优先relegate, premium保护\n// - 仅5% relegation即可在极端过载下维持SLO\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **α参数**: 控制EDF↔SRPF平衡。α=8 ms/token时violation最小; 低负载α=1 ms/token优化tail latency; 高负载α增大以优先短请求\n- **Dynamic Chunking的硬件意义**: 增大chunk → 更多prefill tokens与decode融合执行 → HBM bandwidth利用率提升（decode时memory-bound, prefill可填满空闲带宽）\n- **选择性Preemption**: 仅prefill阶段可抢占（不抢占decode, 避免TBT violation; 不递归抢占）。KV-cache保留在GPU最短必要时间\n- **复杂度**: O(log N_new) — 仅priority queue操作, vs SLOs-Serve的O(N × N_new × M)\n- **Single-Request场景**: QoServe主要面向多请求调度, 但其hybrid prioritization + relegation理念可借鉴到单请求内micro-operator调度——对latency-critical算子(如attention)优先, 对batch算子(如FFN)降级\n\n---\n\n### 方法6: Infera Runtime — Tile-Level DAG Scheduling + Warp-Level Fusion + Daemon Launch\n\n**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/Automated End-to-End Model Serving with Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling.md` (score: 59.0), `idea_notes/Automated End-to-End Model Serving with Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling.md` (score: 117.3)\n\n**方法细节** — 三阶段Kernel调度Pipeline:\n\n```\n// ===== Infera Runtime Dispatcher: SelectKernels → FuseKernels → LaunchKernel =====\n// 平台: NVIDIA A100-PCIE-40GB, CUDA 12.0, GDRCopy, CDP\n\n// === Phase 1: SelectKernels (两阶段kernel选择) ===\n// Stage 1: 选data block — DAG中最大化asynchronous wavefront\nG(u) = Σ_j G(v_j)/(d⁻(v_j)) + 2/|Γ⁺(u)| - 1\n// G(u): 节点u的asynchrony gain (递归定义, transitive dependency propagation)\n// 选择zero in-degree + max G(u)的data blocks\n\n// Stage 2: 选kernel版本 — 优化 min #inst/IPC, 约束 TLP ≥ 4\nfor each data_block:\n    for each micro_kernel_candidate:  // 编译期已生成多版本\n        IPC_est = regression_model(data_hazard_stalls, structure_hazard_stalls)\n        score = #instructions / IPC_est\n        TLP = min(total_warps / SM_count, occupancy_from_regs_shmem)\n        if TLP >= 4:\n            select kernel_with_min_score()\n\n// === Phase 2: FuseKernels (warp-level binary fusion) ===\n// 在SASS/CUDA binary级别做水平融合\nunified_signature: __global__ void fused_kernel(void* args)\nprologue:\n    // 每个thread恢复自己的special registers和arguments\n    %tid = load_from_global(args + thread_offset)\n    // 对shared memory访问加offset (物理级base+index寻址)\nfor each original_kernel in fusion_group:\n    // BAR.SYNC barrier资源重组 (thread组织变化后需要)\n    // insert preemption/locking/progress flags\n\n// === Phase 3: LaunchKernel (多级异步Pipeline) ===\nHKQ (Host Kernel Queue):  // priority queue按launch timestamp排序\n    ↓ GDRCopy (gdr_copy_to_mapping, <100ns small / <5μs typical)\nDKQ (Device Kernel Queue):  // GPU侧\n    ↓ daemon kernel (独占1 SM, CDP fire-and-forget launch, <10μs)\nshared-memory double-ended queue:  // 低延迟kernel fetch\n    ↓ cudaLaunchDevice()  // 无需等待前序grids完成\nGPU Scheduler → SM Execution\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **G(u) asynchrony wavefront metric**: 递归传播children的并发收益到parents — 确保选择能最大化下游并发的data block。terminal G(v) = -1\n- **Warp-level fusion**: 在多micro-operator间共享SM资源。BERT warps和ViT warps交错排布在同一SM → 降低scoreboard/throttle stall cycles\n- **Daemon Kernel Launch**: 通过CDP (CUDA Dynamic Parallelism) 从GPU内部fire-and-forget发射kernel, <10μs延迟。避免Host→Device kernel launch的PCIe往返（~5-10μs/次）\n- **Preemption**: Infera-P ~10μs (暂停HKQ→DKQ保存), Infera-R ~5μs (仅保存不暂停)。比REEF-N快 ~2.5×\n- **硬件交互深度**: GDRCopy bypass DMA engines (直接PCIe BAR映射), daemon kernel独占1 SM, shared-memory double-ended queue实现device-side低延迟kernel fetch — 这是最深度的硬件-软件协同dispatcher设计\n\n---\n\n### 方法7: Arithmetic Intensity-Aware Dispatcher (SADDLE PIM-GPU)\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Arithmetic Intensity-Aware PIM-GPU Operator Scheduling（算术强度感知的PIM-GPU算子调度）.md` (score: 333.5)\n\n**方法细节** — CI-Based Dynamic Mapping:\n\n```\n// ===== SADDLE Dispatcher: CI阈值比较 → Operator-to-Device映射 =====\n// 平台: PIM+GPU异构系统 (HBM-PIM PE array + A100 GPU)\n\n// Offline预标定 (一次性)\nPIM_peak_compute = 2.4 TFLOPS     // HBM-PIM PE array\nPIM_peak_bw      = 144 TB/s       // PIM internal bandwidth\nPIM_ridge = PIM_peak_compute / PIM_peak_bw  // ~16.7 FLOP/Byte\n\nGPU_peak_compute = 312 TFLOPS     // A100 Tensor Core FP16\nGPU_peak_bw      = 1.5 TB/s       // HBM2e\nGPU_ridge = GPU_peak_compute / GPU_peak_bw  // ~208 FLOP/Byte\n\n// Runtime per-iteration调度\nFunction SCHEDULE_OPERATOR(op_type, eff_batch_size):\n    FLOPs = estimate_flops(op_type, eff_batch_size)\n    Bytes = estimate_bytes(op_type, eff_batch_size)\n    CI = FLOPs / Bytes  // Arithmetic Intensity\n    \n    if CI < PIM_ridge:\n        target = \"PIM\"   // memory-bound → PIM (高带宽)\n    elif CI > GPU_ridge:\n        target = \"GPU\"   // compute-bound → GPU (高算力)\n    else:\n        target = \"GPU\"   // intermediate → GPU (避免PIM编程复杂度)\n    \n    return target\n\n// 动态性示例: DLM FC operator\n// eff_bs=12 → CI≈12 → < GPU_ridge but > PIM_ridge → GPU\n// eff_bs=4  → CI≈4  → < PIM_ridge → PIM\n// 短draft请求先完成后batch缩小 → 同一operator最佳设备随batch变化\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **硬件差异化利用**: PIM ridge point (16.7 FLOP/Byte) vs GPU ridge point (208 FLOP/Byte) — 差距13×。PIM适合极度memory-bound算子, GPU适合compute-bound算子\n- **运行时效率**: 仅需预标定阈值 + 简单代数运算 (FLOPs和Bytes估算), 无需完整profiling。适合单请求内频繁的per-iteration调度决策\n- **Single-Request适用性**: Speculative decoding中每个prediction/verification iteration都需重新决策 — 适合单请求内微算子动态调度\n- **笔记未明确说明**: NPU的ridge point (昇腾910B: 256 TFLOPS FP16, HBM2e 1.2 TB/s → ridge ≈ 213 FLOP/Byte)\n\n---\n\n### 方法8: Micro-Batch CUDA Stream Pipeline Dispatcher (MPipeMoE)\n\n**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/MPipeMoE_ Memory Efficient MoE for Pre-trained Models with Adaptive Pipeline Parallelism.md` (score: 56.3)\n\n**方法细节** — 多Stream干扰建模 + 自适应调度:\n\n```\n// ===== MPipeMoE Dispatcher: 3-Stream Pipeline + Interference Model =====\n// 平台: 8×NVIDIA DGX A100 (64 GPU), CUDA 11.1, NCCL\n\n// Stream配置\nstream_comp:  // GeMM kernel (expert FFN)\nstream_comm:  // NCCL All-to-All (token dispatch + collect)\nstream_mem:   // cudaMemcpy D2H/H2D (optional, 某些strategy无此stream)\n\n// === Interference Profiling (离线) ===\n// 量化并行执行时的slowdown因子\nμ_comm = W_comm × t_alone / (Bytes / t_parallel)  // 通信slowdown (因与计算并行)\nσ_comp = 类似定义  // 计算slowdown (实测≈1, 几乎不受影响)\nη_mem  = 类似定义  // memory copy slowdown (通信+拷贝并行时显著)\n\n关键发现:\n- σ≈1: 计算几乎不被其他stream干扰 → 通信-计算重叠可行\n- μ_comm>0.5: 通信受计算干扰但可接受\n- η_small: 通信+memory copy并行时带宽竞争严重 → 避免\n\n// === Pipeline执行模型 (5阶段: P0-P4) ===\nb = B/n  // micro-batch size\nq1 = comp_ops_count, q2 = comm_ops_count, q3 = mem_ops_count\n\nT_fw = max(q1 × FLOPs(b) / (σ × W_comp(b)),\n           q2 × Bytes(b) / (μ × W_comm(b)),\n           q3 × Bytes(b) / (η × W_mem(b)))\n\n// === Adaptive Strategy Selector ===\n// 4种memory reuse策略 (S1-S4), 不同(N,B)组合选最优\nS1: forward 3 streams, backward 3 streams\nS2: forward 3 streams, backward 3 streams (extra comm)\nS3: forward 3 streams, backward 3 streams (extra recompute)\nS4: forward 2 streams (no mem), backward 3 streams (extra comm+recompute)\n\n// 选择: min T_total(n, S) over n∈{1,2,4,8,16}, S∈{S1,S2,S3,S4}\n// N小(8 GPU): S1/S2更优 (I/O bound场景)\n// N大(64 GPU): S4更优 (避免memory bandwidth竞争)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **Pipeline Granularity n**: 影响kernel launch频率和GPU利用率。n=1 (粗粒度): 少launch但气泡大; n=16 (细粒度): 多launch但气泡小、重叠好\n- **硬件平台特化**: MPipeMoE的调度决策高度依赖DGX A100的NVLink 3.0 + NVSwitch拓扑。不同硬件需重新profiling μ/σ/η因子\n- **Single-Request映射**: micro-batch = 单请求内的token分组, pipeline = micro-operator流水线, 理念直接适用于单请求微算子并发\n\n---\n\n### 方法9: Shepherd Operator — 调度粒度优化抽象 (Infera)\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Shepherd Operator.md` (score: 658.1), `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md` (score: 60.0)\n\n**方法细节**:\n\n```\n// ===== Shepherd Operator: 小Operator合并 → 降低调度开销 =====\n// 问题: elementwise add/activation (执行仅~几μs) \n//       作为独立micro-operator调度 → scheduling/fusion/launch overhead >> 执行时间\n\n// 解决: Compiler在graph partition阶段识别小operator子图 → 合并为Shepherd Operator\nComputation Graph Partition:\n  ├── Large operators → micro operators (tiled)\n  │    e.g., Conv2D → Conv_tile_0, Conv_tile_1, ...\n  │    每个tile独立编译为micro-kernel\n  └── Small operators → Shepherd Operator (merged)\n       e.g., [Add, ReLU, BatchNorm] → Shepherd_0\n       Shepherd kernel内部按拓扑顺序调用: k_add → k_relu → k_bn\n       对外表现为单一调度单元 (一个micro operator)\n\n// 调度效果: per-micro-operator → per-shepherd-operator\n// 调度开销减少 N× (N=合并的小operator数)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **调度粒度权衡**: 过细 (per-μs-operator) → launch overhead主导; 过粗 (per-layer) → 丢失并发机会。Shepherd Operator在两者间取得平衡\n- **硬件意义**: 每次CUDA kernel launch约 5-10μs overhead (PCIe command传输 + command processor处理)。合并10个2μs小算子 → 20μs执行+10μs launch → 节省9次launch (~45-90μs)\n- **TEU (Task Execution Unit) 兼容**: Shepherd operator在Infera runtime的SelectKernels/FuseKernels/LaunchKernel pipeline中表现为单一调度单元, 减少metadata和fusion开销\n- **适用性**: 广泛适用于所有模型中的elementwise/normalization/activation类微算子\n\n---\n\n## 二、硬件平台对比：Dispatcher实现的硬件差异\n\n### 2.1 GPU平台 (NVIDIA CUDA)\n\n| 调度机制 | 硬件能力 | 延迟 | Dispatcher适配策略 |\n|----------|----------|------|---------------------|\n| CUDA Stream | 128 hardware queues (A100/H100), 多流并发执行 | kernel launch: 5-10μs | MPipeMoE 3-stream pipeline; ACS-SW multi-stream dispatch |\n| CUDA Event + cudaStreamWaitEvent | 跨流异步同步, 无需CPU介入 | event signal: ~1μs | ACS-SW内跨stream依赖同步; MuxWise prefill/decode同步 |\n| GreenContext (CUDA 12.4+) | 进程内SM分区, 2个独立CUDA context | repartition: ~4.1μs | MuxWise/Bullet 动态SM分区 |\n| MPS (Multi-Process Service) | 跨进程空间复用, 无SM显式分区 | context switch: ~μs | 适合多请求高并发, 不适合单请求微算子 (笔记未明确) |\n| MIG (Multi-Instance GPU) | 硬件级SM+内存隔离 (A100/H100) | 需重启GPU配置 | 粗粒度, 不适合动态微算子调度 |\n| CUDA Dynamic Parallelism (CDP) | GPU内parent→child kernel launch | launch: <10μs | Infera daemon kernel fire-and-forget launch |\n| GDRCopy | GPU memory CPU direct access, bypass DMA | copy: <100ns small / <5μs typical | Infera HKQ→DKQ kernel metadata传输 |\n| CUDA Graph | 预录制DAG, 单次launch全图执行 | construction: ~47% 执行时间 (ACS paper) | 不适合input-dependent DAG (如动态MoE路由) |\n\n### 2.2 NPU平台 (华为昇腾 Ascend / 寒武纪 MLU)\n\n**笔记证据**: 笔记中NPU dispatcher具体机制信息有限（搜索 \"NPU task descriptor queue\" 无结果）。根据笔记中TZ-LLM的RK3588 NPU co-driver设计可部分推断。\n\n| 调度机制 | 硬件能力 | Dispatcher适配 |\n|----------|----------|-----------------|\n| Task Descriptor Queue | NPU硬件FIFO队列, task按序发射 | TZ-LLM co-driver: REE scheduler管理统一队列, secure job通过shadow机制插入 |\n| NPU Barrier Instruction | 硬件同步原语, 类似GPU __syncthreads/bar.sync | 笔记未明确说明NPU barrier语义和延迟 |\n| NPU World Switch (TZPC/TZASC) | TEE↔REE NPU访问权限切换 | TZ-LLM: secure job前后配置TZPC+TZASC+GIC, monotonic sequence number防重放 |\n\n**笔记明确说明**: \n- TZ-LLM中NPU为3-core ~6 TOPS (RK3588), 通过co-driver方式由REE管理scheduling/power/frequency (control plane), TEE data plane仅负责secure job context/MMIO launch/interrupt completion\n- **笔记未明确说明**: 昇腾CANN的Ascend Graph task调度机制、寒武纪MLU的task descriptor chain格式、NPU是否支持类似CUDA stream的多队列并发\n\n### 2.3 TPU平台 (Google TPU v5e/v5p)\n\n**笔记证据**: 笔记中关于TPU dispatcher的信息主要来自XLA编译期调度的间接提及。\n\n| 调度机制 | 硬件能力 | Dispatcher适配 |\n|----------|----------|-----------------|\n| XLA Compile-Time Scheduling | 编译期确定全部执行顺序, 运行时无动态调度 | 静态DAG→固定execution plan; 不支持input-dependent DAG |\n| TPU Device-Side Scheduling | TPU runtime管理device execution | 笔记未明确说明TPU device-side dispatcher细节 |\n| Collective Permute | TPU的all-to-all通信原语 | 可用于MoE expert dispatch通信, 笔记未明确其与dispatcher交互 |\n\n**笔记未明确说明**: TPU v5e/v5p的MXU/VPU之间是否有类似GPU SM的细粒度动态分区; TPU是否支持类似CUDA Dynamic Parallelism的device-side kernel launch\n\n---\n\n## 三、硬件同步原语对 Dispatcher 设计的影响\n\n### 3.1 GPU 同步原语\n\n```\n// === GPU同步原语层级 ===\n// Level 1: Device级 — 全局同步, 开销最大\ncudaDeviceSynchronize()          // ~10-50μs, 等待所有stream完成\ncudaStreamSynchronize(stream)    // ~5-10μs, 等待单stream完成\n\n// Level 2: Stream级 — 跨stream异步同步, 中等开销\ncudaStreamWaitEvent(stream, event)  // ~1μs, GPU内信号, 无需CPU\ncudaEventRecord(event, stream)      // ~0.5μs\n\n// Level 3: Block/Warp级 — SM内同步, 最低开销\n__syncthreads()     // block内barrier, ~10-20 cycles (~10ns)\n__syncwarp()        // warp内同步 (CC 7.0+)\nBAR.SYNC            // SASS级别barrier, Infera用于warp fusion后重组\n\n// Level 4: 数据级 — 无同步, register-level\nwarp shuffle (__shfl_sync)  // ~1 cycle, lane间数据交换\n```\n\n**Dispatcher设计影响**:\n- **ACS-SW**: 被迫使用cudaStreamSynchronize (Level 1) → 引入CPU-GPU同步瓶颈。ACS-HW通过硬件调度窗口消除此开销\n- **Infera**: FuseKernels后需重组BAR.SYNC (Level 3) — warp fusion改变thread组织, 原kernel的barrier不再有效\n- **MuxWise**: 依赖cudaStreamWaitEvent (Level 2) 实现prefill/decode stream间的异步同步 — 避免CPU轮询\n\n### 3.2 NPU 同步原语\n\n**笔记证据**: 笔记未详细描述NPU barrier instruction的具体语义和延迟。TZ-LLM中通过monotonic sequence number + interrupt completion实现NPU job同步。笔记未明确说明NPU是否支持类似GPU warp shuffle的细粒度同步。\n\n### 3.3 同步开销对 Dispatcher 设计的影响总结\n\n| 同步层级 | GPU开销 | Dispatcher策略 | 硬件依赖 |\n|----------|---------|----------------|----------|\n| Device同步 (cudaDeviceSynchronize) | 10-50μs | 避免 — ACS-HW用硬件窗口替代 | Command Processor |\n| Stream同步 (cudaStreamWaitEvent) | ~1μs | 适度使用 — MuxWise prefill/decode同步 | CUDA Event机制 |\n| Block同步 (__syncthreads) | ~10ns | 必须 — kernel内部tile边界 | SM warp scheduler |\n| Warp同步 (warp shuffle) | ~1 cycle | 首选 — register-level数据交换 | SM warp scheduler |\n| NPU interrupt completion | ~μs? (笔记未明确) | TZ-LLM: secure job完成信号 | NPU interrupt controller |\n\n---\n\n## 四、Dispatcher 与硬件 Command Processor / DMA Engine 交互\n\n### 4.1 GPU Command Queue 机制\n\n```\n// ===== NVIDIA GPU Command Processing Pipeline =====\nApplication (CPU)                GPU\n    │                              │\n    ├─ cudaLaunchKernel() ──→  Command Queue (Device-mapped memory)\n    │                            │\n    │                         Command Processor (CP):\n    │                            ├─ 从各queue头部取kernel\n    │                            ├─ 检查依赖 (仅stream内顺序)\n    │                            ├─ 分配SM资源\n    │                            └─ 发射到execution units\n    │\n    ├─ ACS-HW: 修改CP行为\n    │   └─ Scheduling Window → 乱序从多queue选READY kernel\n    │\n    ├─ CUDA Graph: 预构建DAG\n    │   └─ 单次launch → CP按DAG批量发射 (无运行时依赖检测)\n    │\n    └─ Infera: 绕过部分CP\n        └─ daemon kernel via CDP → GPU内部发射 (跳过host→device path)\n```\n\n### 4.2 DMA Engine 交互\n\n| 机制 | 延迟 | Dispatcher利用 |\n|------|------|----------------|\n| GDRCopy (gdr_copy_to_mapping) | <100ns (small) / <5μs (typical) | Infera: HKQ→DKQ kernel metadata快速传输, bypass DMA engines |\n| cuMemcpyHtoDAsync | ~5-10μs launch + 带宽受限 | MPipeMoE: 独立memory copy stream, 与compute/comm重叠 |\n| GPU Direct RDMA | 跨GPU直接传输, 无CPU参与 | MegaScale-Infer: attention↔expert节点token传输 |\n| DMA Engine (标准) | ~μs级完成 | 笔记未明确其与dispatcher调度决策的交互延迟 |\n\n### 4.3 NPU/TPU 等价的 Command Processor 机制\n\n**笔记未明确说明**: \n- 昇腾Ascend的task descriptor queue的command processor架构\n- TPU的XLA runtime是否有等价的device-side scheduling能力\n- NPU/TPU是否支持类似CUDA Dynamic Parallelism的device-side kernel launch\n- NPU/TPU的DMA engine与dispatcher的交互模式\n\n---\n\n## 五、方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心机制 | 调度粒度 | 硬件平台 | 同步方式 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| **MuxWise SLO-Aware Dispatcher** | Decode优先SM分区 + Contention-tolerant estimation + Prefill preemption | Layer级 (layer-wise multiplexing) | NVIDIA A100/H100/H200 | CUDA Event (cudaStreamWaitEvent) | SM分区延迟 ~4.1μs; TBT SLO: 50ms(8B)/100ms(70B) | paper_secs 3.4-SLO-aware-Dispatcher (5286.6) |\n| **Bullet Dynamic SM Repartitioning** | SLO-aware repartition command → libsmctrl_set_stream_mask | Per prefill layer group / decode step | NVIDIA GPU (A100/H100) | libsmctrl SM mask update | 重分区 ~4.1μs; 16 SM粒度 | knowledge_notes Dynamic SM Repartitioning (46.3) |\n| **TZ-LLM Priority Greedy + Preemptive** | Computation优先DAG调度 + ~64KB micro-operator抢占 | Micro-operator级 (~64KB) | RK3588 (4×A76 + 3-core NPU) | NPU interrupt completion + sequence number | Preemptive降低TTFT 16.2%; pipeline距lower bound 0.01-9.9% | knowledge_notes Pipelined Parameter Restoration (141.3) |\n| **ACS Out-of-Order Dispatch** | 运行时调度窗口 + read/write segment依赖检测 + 乱序发射 | Kernel级 | NVIDIA GPU (ACS-SW: any; ACS-HW: 需硬件支持) | ACS-SW: StreamSync; ACS-HW: GPU内部 | SW: N_stream并发; HW: ~50-100ns dispatch overhead | paper_secs ACS Key Observations (2441.0) |\n| **QoServe Hybrid Prioritization** | EDF+SRPF插值 + Eager Relegation + Dynamic Chunking | Chunk级 (prefill token chunk) | NVIDIA A100/H100 | 三队列优先级 (priority queue) | Goodput 1.5-2.4× vs FCFS; 40%更高负载下零violation | paper_secs QoServe Design (3756.4) |\n| **Infera Runtime** | Tile DAG scheduling (G(u) metric) + Warp-level binary fusion + CDP daemon launch | Tile级 (micro-operator) | NVIDIA A100 (GDRCopy+CDP) | BAR.SYNC重组 + preemption flags | Daemon launch <10μs; Preemption ~5-10μs; 比REEF-N快2.5× | experiment_notes Infera Runtime (59.0) |\n| **SADDLE CI-Aware** | CI vs ridge point比较 → PIM/GPU动态映射 | Operator级 | HBM-PIM + NVIDIA A100 | N/A (per-iteration静态决策) | Dynamic调度使吞吐再提升1.13× | knowledge_notes Arithmetic Intensity-Aware (333.5) |\n| **MPipeMoE Stream Pipeline** | 3-CUDA-stream micro-batch pipeline + interference profiling | Micro-batch级 | 8×DGX A100 (64 GPU, NVLink 3.0) | CUDA Stream async | σ≈1 (计算不受干扰); n自适应选择 | experiment_notes MPipeMoE (56.3) |\n| **HuntKTm Resource-Aware** | 三维资源评估 (threads/regs/shmem) + hardware queue计数 | Task级 | Multi-GPU NVIDIA | 非抢占式, pending queue重试 | 防单一资源维度瓶颈 | knowledge_notes Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (556.8) |\n| **Shepherd Operator** | 编译期小operator合并 → 降低runtime调度粒度 | Shepherd operator级 | 编译期 (Infera/TVM) | N/A (编译期优化) | 调度开销降N× | knowledge_notes Shepherd Operator (658.1) |\n\n---\n\n## 六、实现\n\n### 6.1 MuxWise Dispatcher\n- **框架**: SGLang 0.4.10post2 + PyTorch 2.6.0 + CUDA 12.8\n- **底层**: GreenContext (CUDA 12.4+) SM分区; FlashInfer fused prefill-decode attention kernel\n- **评估**: 8×A100/H100/H200; Llama-8B/70B + Qwen3-235B (MoE); Conversation + Tool&Agent workload\n- **关键结果**: Goodput提升 (vs chunked-prefill, NanoFlow, LoongServe, SGLang-PD); P99 TBT SLO达标\n\n### 6.2 TZ-LLM Dispatcher\n- **框架**: llama.cpp扩展 (~1.2K LoC) + RK3588 NPU co-driver (~1K LoC)\n- **底层**: Arm TrustZone (OP-TEE), OpenSSL AES, CMA memory allocation\n- **评估**: Orange Pi 5 Plus (RK3588); Llama-3-8B, Qwen2.5-7B; TTFT, decoding speed, pipeline critical path overhead\n\n### 6.3 Infera Runtime\n- **框架**: ~17K LoC C++ kernel-space module, 从零开发\n- **底层**: GDRCopy, CUDA Dynamic Parallelism, SASS-level binary manipulation\n- **评估**: A100-PCIE-40GB; BERT + ViT concurrent inference; vs Stream/MPS/Triton/Paella\n\n### 6.4 QoServe Dispatcher\n- **框架**: Sarathi-Serve + vLLM扩展\n- **底层**: Lightweight Random Forest predictor (CPU侧, <10% error); Vidur simulator profiling harness\n- **评估**: 16×A100 cluster; Llama3-8B/70B + Qwen-7B; ShareGPT + Azure Conv/Code traces\n\n---\n\n## 七、实验环境 (辅助说明)\n\n### 7.1 硬件平台\n\n| 硬件 | Dispatcher方法 | 关键规格 |\n|------|---------------|----------|\n| NVIDIA A100-80GB | MuxWise, QoServe, Infera, MPipeMoE, ACS | 108 SM, 312 TFLOPS FP16, 1.5 TB/s HBM2e |\n| NVIDIA H100-80GB | MuxWise, QoServe | 132 SM, 989 TFLOPS FP8, 3.35 TB/s HBM3 |\n| NVIDIA H200-141GB | MuxWise | 132 SM, 989 TFLOPS FP8, 4.8 TB/s HBM3e |\n| RK3588 (ARM+NPU) | TZ-LLM | 4×A76@2.4GHz, 3-core NPU ~6 TOPS, 16GB LPDDR4X |\n| 8×DGX A100 | MPipeMoE | 64 GPU, NVLink 3.0 + NVSwitch, 200 Gbps HDR InfiniBand |\n\n### 7.2 关键Benchmark\n\n| Benchmark | 用途 | 关联方法 |\n|-----------|------|----------|\n| ShareGPT / Azure Conv / Azure Code | LLM serving workload (TTFT/TBT/TTLT SLO评估) | QoServe, MuxWise |\n| Conversation + Tool&Agent traces | Real-world LLM serving load | MuxWise |\n| Micro-benchmark (synthetic) | Interference profiling: μ/σ/η slowdown因子 | MPipeMoE |\n| llm.cpp内置benchmark | TTFT, decoding speed, pipeline overhead | TZ-LLM |\n| BERT + ViT concurrent | Multi-model micro-operator fusion | Infera |\n| Dolly dataset + OPT models | Speculative decoding PIM-GPU scheduling | SADDLE |\n\n### 7.3 关键硬件指标 (辅助说明)\n\n| 指标 | 典型值 | 测量方法 |\n|------|--------|----------|\n| SM重分区延迟 | ~4.1μs | libsmctrl_set_stream_mask() wall-clock |\n| Kernel launch overhead (host→device) | 5-10μs | cudaLaunchKernel() profiling |\n| CDP device-side launch | <10μs | cudaLaunchDevice() profiling |\n| CUDA event signal | ~0.5μs | cudaEventRecord profiling |\n| GDRCopy small payload | <100ns | gdr_copy_to_mapping latency |\n| ACS-HW dispatch overhead | ~50-100ns (64 cycles) | 硬件SRAM + CP逻辑延迟 |\n| NPU interrupt completion | ~μs级 (笔记未精确) | TZ-LLM co-driver测量 |\n\n---\n\n## 八、不确定性\n\n1. **NPU Dispatcher具体机制**: 笔记中关于NPU (昇腾/寒武纪) 的task descriptor queue格式、command processor架构、barrier instruction语义等信息缺失。搜索\"NPU task descriptor queue\"返回0结果。对NPU上微算子dispatcher的设计只能从TZ-LLM的RK3588 NPU co-driver间接推断\n2. **TPU Device-Side Scheduling**: 笔记未包含TPU v5e/v5p运行时dispatcher的详细设计。XLA编译期调度与运行时调度的边界在笔记中未明确\n3. **Groq LPU / Cerebras CS-3**: 笔记中未检索到关于Groq或Cerebras的dispatcher设计资料\n4. **Command Processor修改可行性**: ACS-HW需要修改GPU硬件command processor — 这在商业GPU上不可行（需NVIDIA合作）。实际商用系统的dispatcher仍基于软件（ACS-SW, Infera runtime级别）\n5. **Shepherd Operator阈值**: Infera论文未给出小operator合并的具体FLOPs/执行时间阈值，笔记也未说明\n6. **Single-Request专有优化**: 大部分方法（MuxWise, QoServe, MPipeMoE）面向多请求batch场景，其微算子并发理念可迁移到单请求，但直接适用性需验证。TZ-LLM和ACS是少数天然面向单请求/input-dependent DAG的方法\n\n---\n\n## 九、笔记证据来源\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 贡献内容 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/1-Towards High-Goodput LLM Serving.../3.4-SLO-aware-Dispatcher.md | 5286.6 | SLO-aware Dispatcher完整设计 |\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/4-QoServe.../span-idpage-3-0span3-QoServe-Design-and-Implementation.md | 3756.4 | Hybrid Prioritization + Eager Relegation算法 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/ACS.../D.-Key-Observations.md | 2441.0 | ACS乱序调度: 调度窗口, 依赖检测, ACS-SW/HW双实现 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Resource-Aware Task Dispatching (Multi-GPU).md | 556.8 | 三维资源感知算法 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Pipelined Parameter Restoration.md | 141.3 | Priority greedy + preemptive micro-operator |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Dynamic SM Repartitioning.md | 46.3 | 微秒级SM重分区流程 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Prefill-Decode Multiplexing (PDM).md | 13.4 | GreenContext SM分区机制 |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Shepherd Operator.md | 658.1 | 小operator合并降低调度开销 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Arithmetic Intensity-Aware PIM-GPU Operator Scheduling.md | 333.5 | CI-based动态operator-to-device映射 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Spatial Multiplexing _ Temporal Multiplexing.md | 15.1 | GPU并发策略对比 |\n| experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/TZ-LLM...md | 187.6 | TZ-LLM NPU co-driver实现 |\n| experiment_notes/编译实验笔记/Automated End-to-End Model Serving...md | 95.5 | Infera compiler tile partition |\n| experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/Automated End-to-End Model Serving...md | 59.0 | Infera runtime SelectKernels/FuseKernels/LaunchKernel |\n| experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/MPipeMoE...md | 56.3 | 3-stream micro-batch pipeline |\n| idea_notes/Automated End-to-End Model Serving...md | 117.3 | Tile-level DAG调度设计理念 |\n| idea_notes/TZ-LLM...md | 116.4 | Operator队列抢占调度设计思路 |\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q2.4\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
